<MakerLayout title="Free Tournament Bracket Generator — PARADOX Makers" description="Create a simple printable tournament bracket from a list of players or teams. Free and no account required."><GeneratorTool mode="bracket" title="Tournament Bracket Generator" intro="Turn a list of teams, players or entrants into a clean first-round knockout bracket. Generate it quickly for games, classrooms, clubs or events." steps={['Enter one participant per line.','Generate randomized first-round pairings.','Print the bracket and write winners into the next round.']} faq={[["Can I use team names?","Yes. Use any names or labels you want."],["What happens with an odd number?","The generator adds a BYE to the final unmatched participant."],["Can I print it?","Yes. Use Print / Save PDF in the generator."]]}/></MakerLayout>
